#food delivery prediction model Food Delivery Time Prediction using Logistic Regression  Overview  This project uses Logistic Regression to predict whether a food delivery will be On Time or Delayed based on relevant delivery factors.  Technologies Used  Python  Pandas  NumPy  Matplotlib  Scikit-learn  Google Colab  Model  Logistic Regression (Classification)  Objective  To classify food deliveries into On Time and Delayed categories using Machine Learning.  Author  Pushkaraj Umbare
